# Sealed expectation for kitty-upload-file-more.case, written from upload-rules.md before any implementation.
# Replies are exact. A '# expected in the dump' line says in words what the frame view must show.
> size 20 10
> send "\e_Ga=t,t=f,f=24,s=1,v=1,i=3,m=1;PATH64\e\\"
< (the host's request for the file, then)
< reply "\e_Gi=3;OK\e\\"
> send "\e_Gm=0;\e\\"
> send "\e_Ga=p,i=3,C=1\e\\"
< reply "\e_Gi=3;OK\e\\"
